{"audio": "1corinthians-02.opus", "duration_ms": 128942, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3641, "text": "1 Corinthians, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 5041, "end_ms": 11642, "text": "When I came to you, brothers, I did not come with eloquence or wisdom as I proclaimed to you the testimony about God."}, {"start_ms": 12242, "end_ms": 18083, "text": "For I resolved to know nothing while I was with you except Jesus Christ and Him crucified."}, {"start_ms": 18943, "end_ms": 22204, "text": "I came to you in weakness and fear, and with much trembling."}, {"start_ms": 22704, "end_ms": 33606, "text": "My message and my preaching were not with persuasive words of wisdom, but with a demonstration of the Spirit’s power, so that your faith would not rest on men’s wisdom, but on God’s power."}, {"start_ms": 34586, "end_ms": 42427, "text": "Among the mature, however, we speak a message of wisdom—but not the wisdom of this age or of the rulers of this age, who are coming to nothing."}, {"start_ms": 43147, "end_ms": 49768, "text": "No, we speak of the mysterious and hidden wisdom of God, which He destined for our glory before time began."}, {"start_ms": 50649, "end_ms": 52849, "text": "None of the rulers of this age understood it."}, {"start_ms": 53249, "end_ms": 56570, "text": "For if they had, they would not have crucified the Lord of glory."}, {"start_ms": 57010, "end_ms": 69372, "text": "Rather, as it is written: “No eye has seen, no ear has heard, no heart has imagined, what God has prepared for those who love Him.” But God has revealed it to us by the Spirit."}, {"start_ms": 70092, "end_ms": 73673, "text": "The Spirit searches all things, even the deep things of God."}, {"start_ms": 74253, "end_ms": 78693, "text": "For who among men knows the thoughts of man except his own spirit within him?"}, {"start_ms": 79474, "end_ms": 83794, "text": "So too, no one knows the thoughts of God except the Spirit of God."}, {"start_ms": 84394, "end_ms": 91956, "text": "We have not received the spirit of the world, but the Spirit who is from God, that we may understand what God has freely given us."}, {"start_ms": 92736, "end_ms": 102618, "text": "And this is what we speak, not in words taught us by human wisdom, but in words taught by the Spirit, expressing spiritual truths in spiritual words."}, {"start_ms": 103658, "end_ms": 108058, "text": "The natural man does not accept the things that come from the Spirit of God."}, {"start_ms": 108499, "end_ms": 114279, "text": "For they are foolishness to him, and he cannot understand them, because they are spiritually discerned."}, {"start_ms": 115240, "end_ms": 121241, "text": "The spiritual man judges all things, but he himself is not subject to anyone’s judgment."}, {"start_ms": 121881, "end_ms": 127442, "text": "“For who has known the mind of the Lord, so as to instruct Him?” But we have the mind of Christ."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 2380, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 2380, "e": 3041, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3121, "e": 3441, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 3521, "e": 3641, "si": 0}, {"t": "When", "s": 5041, "e": 5181, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 5281, "e": 5301, "si": 1}, {"t": "came", "s": 5381, "e": 5641, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 5681, "e": 5741, "si": 1}, {"t": "you,", "s": 5781, "e": 5881, "si": 1}, {"t": "brothers,", "s": 5921, "e": 6341, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 6601, "e": 6621, "si": 1}, {"t": "did", "s": 6661, "e": 6801, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 6861, "e": 7021, "si": 1}, {"t": "come", "s": 7101, "e": 7321, "si": 1}, {"t": "with", "s": 7341, "e": 7501, "si": 1}, {"t": "eloquence", "s": 7621, "e": 8181, "si": 1}, {"t": "or", "s": 8241, "e": 8321, "si": 1}, {"t": "wisdom", "s": 8441, "e": 8842, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 8942, "e": 9042, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 9202, "e": 9222, "si": 1}, {"t": "proclaimed", "s": 9302, "e": 9842, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 9882, "e": 9942, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 10002, "e": 10122, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 10222, "e": 10302, "s